# Public base URL. Used for canonical URLs, hreflang alternates, sitemap.xml,
# robots.txt and Open Graph image resolution. Must be the real origin in
# production or search engines will index localhost URLs.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://davijara.uz

# Listings service. When set, src/lib/data/listings.ts calls
#   ${LISTINGS_API_URL}/lots?group=11&index=1&page=1&address=<region>
# and maps the response through `mapApiLot`. That mapper encodes an ASSUMED
# payload shape — https://e-auksion.uz/lots is a client-rendered SPA, so the
# real JSON could not be inspected. Verify it against a live response; it is
# the only place upstream field names appear.
#
# Unset (or on a failed request) the site falls back to the verified records
# plus generated mock lots and shows a visible notice. So this one variable is
# the whole switch from mock to live data.
# LISTINGS_API_URL=https://e-auksion.uz

# Map tile provider for the geographic map at /obyektlar/xarita.
# NOTE: do not restore the legacy configuration, which scraped Google Maps
# tiles from {s}.google.com/vt/ in breach of their terms of service.
# MAP_TILE_URL=
# MAP_TILE_API_KEY=
